# HakOS
- Author: Cribbit
- Version: 1.1.0

## Discription
HakOS is built around a dropdown menu. Once you reach the Home screen press the A/Green button and the menu will appear.
From there you can navigate to the section you need.

![Demo](demo.gif)

## Change Log
| Version | Changes         |
| ------- | --------------- |
| 1.1.0     | Initial release |

## Installation

1. Copy the `HakOS` folder to `/root/themes/` on your pager
2. Navigate to **Settings > General > Theme**
3. Select **HakOS**
4. Enjoy!
